# Lunar Lander is a fully static, client-only game — no backend, no auth,
# no database — so there are currently no required environment variables.
#
# If a deployment target is later chosen that needs a build-time base path
# (e.g. GitHub Pages serving from a /<repo-name>/ subpath), it will be
# documented here as VITE_BASE_PATH and wired into vite.config.ts. See
# PLAN.md "Open Questions" for the pending hosting decision.
